  description: "[ Pendulum Effect ] \nDuring your Main Phase: You can add 1 face-up
    \"Pendulum\" Pendulum Monster from your Extra Deck to your hand, then destroy
    this card. You can only use this effect of \"PenduLuMoon\" once per turn.\n\n[
    Monster Effect ] \nDuring your Main Phase: You can add up to 2 face-up Pendulum
    Monsters from your Extra Deck to your hand, with Levels between the Pendulum
    Scales of the 2 cards in your Pendulum Zones, also for the rest of this turn,
    until you Pendulum Summon, you cannot activate monster effects, and the effects
    of any cards in your Pendulum Zones are negated. You can only use this effect
    of \"PenduLuMoon\" once per turn."
